  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b31d412b0817b5fbad0e8f1518c905d0f4fa7922.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"282\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>讓 Faithful 64x 中的所有礦石都採用鑽石礦的外觀，呈現出 1.17 版本之前的樣貌。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此資源包收錄了 Minecraft 中的所有礦石。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>包含鑽石、黃金、鐵、煤、綠寶石、青金石與紅石，甚至還有它們的深板岩變體！</em></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>安裝時，請確保此資源包排在 Faithful 團隊原有的 Faithful 64x 資源包之上（即優先載入）。</strong></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e60dcac487f57c6aefbbb8f2f1e625e1f52a78bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fold-ores-64x-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e32647ae1bbac0c658649d9ae441471c805e564e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
